NAME
    wmtype - text-input WM client (Path C phase 8)

SYNOPSIS
    wmtype [SECONDS]

DESCRIPTION
    Open a 320x200 window via SYS_WM_CREATE and act as a tiny
    text scratchpad.  Keystrokes that arrive while wmtype has
    keyboard focus (i.e. its window was the last one clicked)
    are appended to an in-memory buffer and rendered using the
    8x8 font.

    Special keys:
      Backspace / DEL    remove last character
      Enter              insert newline
      printable ASCII    append

    Click the red "X" in the top-right of the window to clear
    the buffer.

    Exit after SECONDS (default 30) or when the WM closes the
    window.

EXIT STATUS
    0  normal exit (timer or window close)
    1  SYS_WM_CREATE failed (no wmd running)

SEE ALSO
    wmd(1), wmhello(1)
